{"channelId":"UCVW06fnJSWKWw6Dr2QiCccA","row":["Arizona Orthopedic Physical Therapy & Kids Place",4720,"At AzOPT and Kids Place, our mission is to create long lasting results through one-on-one personalized care, detailed explanations, and education. \n\nOur highly-educated, licensed physical therapists at AzOPT help patients reduce pain, improve mobility and restore function. Whether you need to return to sports, work, or simply performing daily activities pain free, our physical therapy programs are tailored to the individual needs of each patient.\n\nSince 2008, the highly trained and licensed pediatric therapists at Kids Place have worked exclusively with the pediatric population to provide pediatric physical, occupational, speech, and feeding therapy.\n\nWelcome to our channel!","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVW06fnJSWKWw6Dr2QiCccA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVW06fnJSWKWw6Dr2QiCccA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:49.828Z","channelId":"UCVW06fnJSWKWw6Dr2QiCccA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"a7680e3cc6e449526fe7c1a5c6430948a675852f3f8cf5e5520e15a6556afb58","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"e27e79ff722368d08bcda9ed2a9ed6531324769b178d6c27ce7bf9cfb156221e"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVW06fnJSWKWw6Dr2QiCccA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":4720,"raw":"4.72K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVW06fnJSWKWw6Dr2QiCccA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:49.828Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["physical therapist"],"relevantKeywords":["physical therapist"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"name_only","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频道简介与保存的采集